*.svg
benchmarks

errors
tmp

# cosmic-ray sessions, written into the root by the commands
# CONTRIBUTING.md gives: one row per mutant, and megabytes of them. What
# is worth keeping is uploaded by mutation.yml as an artifact, where it
# expires; a session committed here would be a snapshot of a suite that
# has moved on
*.sqlite
